                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='8'>Female beneficiaries represent 53% of the national Medicare inpatient </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='8'>population on average. Payment per discharge varies between $10,616 and </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='8'>$16,928 across states, with western states showing consistently higher </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='8'>payments driven by CMS wage index adjustments.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='8'>Data note: Age share computed from CMS-reported age group counts. </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='8'>589 hospitals show minor age count discrepancies due to CMS small </run>
